<title>USA: Archer Daniels Midland may issue debt.</title>
<headline>Archer Daniels Midland may issue debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Archer Daniels Midland Co is expected to tap the corporate bond market with a $300 million debt offering as early as Tuesday, syndicate sources said.</p>
<p>The deal is expected to consist of a 30-year noncallable debt issue, they said.</p>
<p>Salomon Brothers Inc is expected to underwrite the offering, they added.</p>
<p>No further details were available.</p>
<p>((--Nancy Leinfuss, 212-859-1675 ))</p>
</text>
